    "explanation": "সঠিক উত্তরঃ on the whole \n• By and large (idiom):  \nEnglish Meaning - on the whole; everything considered. \nBangla Meaning - মোটকথা; সামগ্রিকভাবে। \n• Example Sentences:  \n- There are a few small things that I don't like about \nmy job, but by and large it's very enjoyable. \n- Mammals have, by and large, bigger brains than \nreptiles.  \nSource:  \n1. Oxford Dictionary.  \n2. Accessible Dictionary by Bangla Academy."
